# concept DOI from `doi:` once the first release is archived on Zenodo.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Q-Swarm"
abstract: >-
  Q-Swarm: Q-routing with energy-aware Bellman updates and Boltzmann next-hop
  selection, bridging pheromone tables and lightweight on-node reinforcement
  learning, as a simulator-agnostic C++23 core on swarm-core's ports with thin
  ns-3 and Linux adapters (planned).
